      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAXIMUM SUNSET (6) wasn't far away at the finish when 4th and beaten only 3.5 lengths (22.48) at Ballarat. The form from her last run stacks up well. Can bounce back. HARTLAND BONNIE (7) charged out of the boxes with a fast early split and led throughout to score when a 4.5 lengths winner (22.40) over 390m at Shepparton. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. One of the leading chances again. COLLECTIVE KAOS (8) finds it hard to win. Finished in the money last time though when second (22.69) at this track. Form here sound including two wins. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from six attempts. Will give a great sight again. LEKTRA HOPPER (4) was out of the frame here most recently but can atone.",
